'''Ord Mantell City''' was the [[capital]] [[city]] of<ref name="Dawn of Rebellion">''[[Star Wars: Dawn of Rebellion: The Visual Guide]]''</ref> the [[planet]] [[Ord Mantell]]. The [[Black Sun]] criminal syndicate operated a [[Black Sun stronghold|base]] in Ord Mantell City, which was the location of a [[Battle on Ord Mantell|battle]] between the [[Shadow Collective]] and [[Confederacy of Independent Systems]], resulting in significant damage to the city,<ref name="Son of Dathomir, Part Two" />

During the [[Imperial Era]], the rogue [[Clone Force 99]] began working alongside the [[information broker]] [[Ciddarin Scaleback]], who was based in Ord Mantell City and operated her [[Cid's Parlor|parlor]] there.<ref name="Rampage" />

